    "title": "Michigan State vs Louisville schedule, TV channel for March Madness",
    "text": "Updated March 20, 2026, 9:28 a.m. MTNo. 6 seed Louisville and No. 3 seed Michigan State play in a March Madness NCAA Tournament men's college basketball game on Saturday, March 21.Here's what to know about the time, TV channel, streaming information and announcers for the East Region March Madness second-round game.Louisville defeated No. 11 seed South Florida in the first round of the NCAA Tournament, 83-79.Michigan State beat No. 14 seed North Dakota State in the Round of 64 of March Madness, 92-67.The winner of this game will advance to the Sweet 16 of the NCAA Tournament.How to watch March Madness: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round game schedule, TV channelsWatch Michigan State vs Louisville on FUBO (free trial)What time is the Louisville vs Michigan State March Madness game?The Michigan State vs Louisville NCAA Tournament March Madness second-round game is scheduled for 11:45 a.m. MST on Saturday, March 21.Join the madness: USA TODAY Bracket Challenge | Survivor Pool | Printable bracket | Your picks vs expertsWhat channel is the Michigan State vs Louisville March Madness game on?The Louisville vs Michigan State Round of 32 March Madness NCAA Tournament game can be seen on CBS.March Madness picks: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round score predictionsHow can I stream the Louisville vs Michigan State March Madness game?Michigan State vs Louisville can be streamed on FUBO and other streaming services that carry CBS. FUBO offers a free trial.Who are the announcers for the Michigan State vs Louisville March Madness game?Brian Anderson will have the play-by-play call of the Louisville Cardinals vs Michigan State Spartans NCAA Tournament Round of 32 game, with Jim Jackson as the analyst and Allie LaForce as the reporter for the March Madness second-round matchup.March Madness odds: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round game oddsReach Jeremy Cluff at jeremy.cluff@arizonarepublic.com. Follow him on X, formerly Twitter @Jeremy_Cluff.Support local journalism: Subscribe to azcentral.com today. Sign up for azcentral Preps Now. And be sure to subscribe to our daily sports newsletters so you don't miss a thing.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
